<%#
  THE CALCULATOR'S CARD (2026-10-21; plan 2026-10-21-calculator-modal.md), drawn first under
  Calculate and look up (Tools::HomeController::BUILT_IN). The calculator is a core feature — a modal
  that opens over any page (layouts/_calculator.html.erb) — so its card is written here and is not
  an addon card in disguise: it is `.tool-card`, never `.addon-card`, so every `.addon-card` on the
  page is still one a manifest made — which is what test/controllers/tools/home_controller_test.rb
  counts. The inner head/icon/title/description classes are shared for their look.

  THE TITLE IS THE CONTROL, AS ON AN ADDON CARD (2026-11-23, the owner's call: no Open button on any
  card). It is a <button>, not a link, because it opens the modal (`data-calculator-open`) rather
  than going anywhere, and `.addon-card-link` stretches it over the card (pages/tools.css), so a
  click anywhere on the card opens the calculator; a right click pins it. At phone width, where the
  tab bar keeps its four destinations and there is no rail, this card IS the way to the calculator
  (the Tools tab). It is also what Esc from the right-click menu hands focus back to
  (toolmenu_controller.js takes the first control in a card), and what the modal hands focus back
  to when it closes. `id="calculator"` is where the pinned rail link's href lands when its click is
  not the controller's to handle (a modified click).
%>
<%= tag.div class: "tool-card calculator-card", id: "calculator",
            data: tool_menu_data(Maker::ToolPins::CALCULATOR, "Calculator") do %>
  <span class="addon-card-head">
    <span class="addon-icon" aria-hidden="true"><%= rail_icon(:calculator) %></span>
    <button type="button" class="addon-title addon-card-link calculator-card-open" id="tool-title-calculator"
            data-calculator-open aria-haspopup="dialog"
            aria-keyshortcuts="<%= CalculationsHelper::CALCULATOR_KEYS %>">Calculator</button>
  </span>
  <span class="addon-desc muted">Lengths in mm, cm, m, inches and feet, inch fractions, and
    conversions. Save a result to a project. <span class="calculator-card-keys">Opens over any page
    with <kbd><%= calculator_shortcut %></kbd>.</span></span>
<% end %>
